<title>USA: Household offering priced at $110.50/shr.</title>
<headline>Household offering priced at $110.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>PROSPECT HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Household International Inc, the consumer finance company, said Friday its offering of common stock was priced at $110.50 a share.</p>
<p>The company also said the offering was increased to 9.1 million shares from the 8.6 million originally contemplated, including the underwriters' over-allotment option.</p>
<p>Of the total offering, 80 percent of the shares were offered in the United States.</p>
<p>Household said the proceeds of the offering will be used to repay certain short-term borrowings in connection with its previously-announced agreement to acquire the capital stock of Transamerica Financial Services Holding Co.</p>
<p>Household shares closed up 2-3/8 to 113-1/2 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
